	(text "Signals used: D0-D7, A0-A15, MREQ*, IORQ*, RD*, WR*, M1*, RESET*  (in)\nWAIT*, INT*  (open drain out; pull-ups on the backplane)\nBAI->BAO and IEI->IEO are linked on the card (daisy chains pass through).\nNo CLK used: the card runs from the Tang Nano's own 27 MHz oscillator."
