	(text "U4 (hardware/gal/ecb_mem_decode.pld): DP_CE_N = MREQ* & (RD*|WR*) in 0x3000-0x37DF\n     (0x37FF with the FULL jumper).\nU5 (hardware/gal/ecb_io_decode.pld): IORD/IOWR = IORQ* & M1* high & RD*/WR*\n     on ports 0x50-0x53 (0x70-0x73 with PORT ALT).\n     A1:A0 go to the FPGA: 0 APU data, 1 APU cmd/status, 2 GFX data, 3 GFX cmd/status."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
