	(text "U2: Z80 memory cycles to the DPRAM (RD* low = read).\nU3: Z80 I/O cycles to the FPGA ports; ECB RD* sets the direction (IN = IORQ* + RD*).\n     The FPGA enables it via PORT_OE_N only after parking its own DPRAM access (shared XD bus)."
