	(text "All 20K header I/O is 3.3 V. 30 of the 34 header I/Os are used; none spare.\nLeft free: P75/P76 (BL616 HSPI), P51 (audio amp enable: the FPGA drives it low),\nP79 (on-board WS2812: driven low).\nLED pins P15-P20 carry active-low outputs or push-pull inputs only, so the\nmodule LEDs show activity: LED0 DPRAM access, LED1 FPGA write, LED2 port cycle,\nLED3 lit except during IN, LED4 BUSY collision, LED5 reset.\nLeave the module's TF slot empty (P80/P85 are its D2/D1 lines).\nModule +3V3 output powers the card's 3.3 V logic (no second regulator)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 607.06 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "59f9d166-ba3b-5072-a53b-4850f0fbee59")
	)
