	(text "MEMORY MAP (Z80 side, IDT7132 left port)\n  0x3000-0x33FF  FRAME BUFFER  1024 bytes = 64x16, sprite engine output, LDIR to 0x3C00\n  0x3400-0x37DF  bulk data area (sprite shapes, tile maps, APU vectors)\n  0x37E0-0x37FF  Expansion Interface (not decoded unless FULL jumper)\n\nI/O MAP  (block 0x50-0x53, or 0x70-0x73 with PORT ALT)\n  0x50 Am9511 data   0x51 Am9511 cmd/status   0x52 sprite param/result   0x53 sprite cmd/status\n\nALL PARTS THROUGH-HOLE. Socket U1, U4, U5 and the Tang Nano 20K.\nVERIFY before ordering: IDT7132 DIP-48 pinout; Tang Nano 20K row spacing (20.32 mm assumed)\nand header orientation (pads 1/21 at the USB-C end)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 355.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
